Operational checklist
Before publishing a transformed dataset, confirm that:

raw input remains reproducible and unchanged;
the contract and threshold versions are recorded;
transformations are deterministic for business fields;
rejected records retain their original identifiers and failure reasons;
metrics use stable denominators and definitions;
the quality decision is machine-readable;
